//RS /// Parse a transcript file: return `(inputs, expected_outputs)`.
//RS /// Lines `> input` become inputs; non-comment, non-`>` lines become expected.
//RS /// Lines starting with `# ` are comments. Blank expected-output lines are
//RS /// represented as blank strings (the transcript may expect a blank output line).
